   "kind": "callout",
   "variant": "blue",
   "children": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "GPT-6 is rolling out in Chat to eligible Business workspaces. If you don’t see "
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "GPT-6",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " in the model menu, it may not be available for your workspace yet."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "GPT‑6 Pro, powered by GPT‑6 Astra, is available in ChatGPT for Pro $100, Pro $200, Business and Enterprise plans. Enterprise access also depends on your workspace’s model-access permissions. Plus plans include GPT‑6 Astra in ChatGPT Work and Codex."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Astra requires Codex CLI version "
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "0.153.0 or newer",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": ". If you do not see Astra in Chat, Work, or Codex in the desktop app, open "
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Menu > Check for Updates",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " and install the latest available version. Check manually even if you recently updated through an automatic update notification or the update icon in the sidebar."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "callout",
   "variant": "transparent",
   "children": [
    {
     "kind": "h",
     "level": 1,
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Overview"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "ChatGPT Business includes ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, and Codex. The plan offers two types of seats: Standard and Premium, which include usage for ChatGPT features such as thinking models, coding, and agentic features. Premium seats offer more included usage for ChatGPT Work and Codex; individual ChatGPT model allowances are separate. Model and feature availability also depend on your workspace settings."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "For additional usage beyond included allowances, see:"
      },
      {
       "kind": "a",
       "href": "https://help.openai.com/articles/11487671",
       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": " "
        },
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "Flexible pricing for the Enterprise, Edu, and Business plans",
         "marks": [
          "u"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": ", and the ChatGPT Rate Card."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
