    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "These Chat allowances are separate from usage in Work and Codex. For model availability and limits, see: "
      },
      {
       "kind": "a",
       "href": "https://help.openai.com/articles/20001354",
       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "GPT-6 and other models in ChatGPT"
