     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Depending on your workspace, Work and Codex may also offer GPT-6 Astra and GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna. Check the model picker for enabled options. GPT-5.6 Terra and GPT-5.6 Luna are also unavailable in regular ChatGPT conversations."
