   "children": [
    {
     "kind": "h",
     "level": 1,
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Note on unlimited access"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Virtually unlimited access applies to "
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Instant",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " chat and remains subject to safeguards against misuse. It does not make reasoning, Pro, ChatGPT Work, Codex, or other tools unlimited. Automatic reasoning may use your reasoning allowance even while "
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Instant",
       "marks": [
        "b"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " remains selected. However, usage must adhere to our"
      },
      {
       "kind": "a",
       "href": "https://openai.com/policies/services-agreement/",
       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": " "
        },
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "Services Agreement",
         "marks": [
          "u"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": ", which prohibits, among other things:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "ul",
     "items": [
      [
       {
        "kind": "p",
        "children": [
         {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Abusive usage, such as automatically or programmatically extracting data."
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "kind": "p",
        "children": [
         {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Sharing your account credentials or making your account available to anyone else."
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "kind": "p",
        "children": [
         {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Reselling access or using ChatGPT to power third-party services."
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "We have guardrails in place to help prevent misuse and are always working to improve our systems. This may occasionally involve a temporary restriction on your usage. We will inform you when this happens, and if you think this might be a mistake, please don’t hesitate to reach out to our support team. If policy-violating behavior is not found, your access will be restored."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "callout",
   "variant": "transparent",
   "children": [
    {
     "kind": "h",
     "level": 1,
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Models and limits"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Your included usage depends on your seat type and the experience you use. Premium seats provide a higher included allowance for ChatGPT Work and Codex. This does not mean every ChatGPT model or feature has a higher limit. Included allowances are different from workspace credits purchased for additional usage."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Standard seats include limited Astra usage within their existing Work and Codex allowance. Premium seats can use their full existing allowance for Astra. Workspace credit purchases are optional. After included usage is exhausted, additional Astra usage can use purchased workspace credits if the workspace has credits and its spending controls allow it."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "For ChatGPT Work and Codex, usage depends on the model, task size, reasoning effort, and amount of work performed. A longer task can use more of your allowance than a short task, so a fixed number of messages is not a reliable measure of remaining usage."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "If you reach an included limit, eligible usage can continue with purchased workspace credits when credits are available and your workspace's spending controls allow it. Otherwise, wait for the applicable allowance to reset or use another available option. Reaching a limit for one experience does not mean every ChatGPT feature is unavailable."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "When a change from Premium to Standard takes effect, the Standard limits apply. A scheduled downgrade does not reduce access before its effective date."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "For current credit charges, see:"
      },
      {
       "kind": "a",
       "href": "https://help.openai.com/articles/11481834",
       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": " "
        },
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "ChatGPT rate card",
         "marks": [
          "u"
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": ", for additional paid usage beyond the limits described below."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
